{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"8522aad9eccfd38f527073bb37aaccdf053ed2ba0bcd00af74f627d27a87be02","ja":"全員集結！","zh":"全员集结！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2b460428371a3ce2798b69cb044dbe0fe1faaba8c79e6c540fc88ef14078a384","ja":"ユリコ、リオ！\nアナウンス、面白かったヨ～♪","zh":"百合子、莉绪！\n刚才的广播很有趣哦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cf84bdacf64e0bc04fdf508b9d0c806ef9ca53e35d2d90154234f9c9441ad8e6","ja":"放送を聞いたお客さんたちが道を開けてくれて、\n進みやすかったです。","zh":"听到广播的客人们给我们让了路，\n走起来顺畅多了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c20440ad2fc9819597cdbaf047ead7a115f62612a7341634c578ad60258569f8","ja":"ステージに来るまでにいっぱい\n応援してもらえたし。楽しかったぞ！","zh":"来舞台前得到了好多\n支持和加油。玩得好开心啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f8537f97ad96e7b2f0995ddeaf72abe0785cec7e12def7b4395959b98688218f","ja":"よかったです！　莉緒さんと一緒に\n考えた甲斐がありました……あっ。あずささ～ん！","zh":"太好了！和莉绪小姐一起\n思考总算没白费……啊。梓小姐～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"1748e0e89cc01769eb643b0486d5d74f6056560d8cac5f2802b35ec7d8ca95c4","ja":"心配かけてごめんなさい。お客さんたちにも\n誘導してもらえて、なんとかたどり着けたわ。","zh":"让你担心了，真对不起。也多亏了客人们\n为我引路，总算是顺利赶到了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"da05a5516e91c7cf2a9eb364cee208385bf390e7931690a65775257641ad46c9","ja":"誘導がなかったら危なかったのね！？\n親切なお客さんばかりで、本当によかったわ！","zh":"要是没人引导的话可就危险了呢！？\n遇到的客人都好热心，真是太好了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9131103db466540d12dfcc44fcbe28e6b2d70b417da5facc98d005741f68f72b","ja":"ええ。みんなを心配させちゃった分、ステージでは\nザ・ファーストとして、しっかり決めてみせるわね。","zh":"嗯。让大家担心了这么久，在舞台上\n我一定会展现出身为主打的气魄，好好表现一番的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"f72295455c22d1d30d4d8d810e1f0efb257033ab1094541fa351607322b7acc0","ja":"私もセクシー攻撃で、お客さんたちの心を\nがっちり掴んでみせるわよ！","zh":"我也会用性感攻势，牢牢\n抓住观众们的心给你看哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"14cdde96ee917744f1a48b6ae486e5624c96be8b03eb92f6a90bdb9bcf996cf3","ja":"ヒーローのキラキラしたかっこよさを、お客さんに\n楽しんでもらえるように……打倒、デストルドー！","zh":"为了能让观众们感受到\n英雄那耀眼帅气的一面……打倒德斯托鲁多！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"e7a0a7d906bf60ff3e638f013a617108596e4adf2aa2b50f8314590e8be1c098","ja":"ワオ♪　でも今日はワタシたちもお客さんから\nたくさんパワーもらったから、負けないヨ～！","zh":"哇哦♪　不过今天我们也从观众那里\n获得了满满的力量，可不会认输哟～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"c7090023bed2a1a381027ff3fcaf6ced535d751507e630cb870e692d55e02234","ja":"はい。お客さんの声援をもらったデストルドーの力を\nお見せしましょう。……覚悟。","zh":"好的。就让你们见识一下获得观众应援的死本能之力吧。\n……做好觉悟吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"d79518c611b114bbbf459ee1a0eec3e80902dc2bb730db6ce311a829cb9b3386","ja":"自分たちが元気をもらった分、お客さんを\nもっとも～っと笑顔にしてあげるからね！","zh":"既然我们得到了满满的活力，\n就一定会让观众露出多～得多的笑容哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1689.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"aadfa9ed325cfd8513575554498fd05d0bce75dea8e703d86a0596455c5c4dbd","ja":"最後のステージも、\nみ～んなでい～っぱい、盛り上げヨ～！","zh":"最后的舞台，\n大家也一起来尽～情嗨起来吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
